{"seq":47,"slug":"large-deviations-theory","title":"大偏差理论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"大偏差理论-稀有事件的指数律\">大偏差理论：稀有事件的指数律</h1><p>抛一枚均匀硬币一万次，正面比例落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 附近是大数定律的必然，落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.55</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.55</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.55</span></span></span></span></span> 附近的涨落幅度由中心极限定理刻画。但如果有人追问：正面比例恰好达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率有多小？这个&quot;离谱到几乎不可能&quot;的事件，中心极限定理已经失效——它只在均值附近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 尺度上有效，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 距均值有宏观距离。大偏差理论正是回答这类问题的数学分支：稀有事件的概率不是随样本量线性变小，而是以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-nI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的指数速度坍缩，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是刻画&quot;这个偏差有多不自然&quot;的率函数。</p>\n<p>本 hub 的主线是一条从直觉到工具再到应用的递进链。<strong>第一章&quot;基础&quot;</strong> 建立世界观：为什么在大数定律与中心极限定理之外还需要第三层理论，稀有事件为何服从指数尺度，以及大偏差原理 (LDP) 的严格定义——上界管闭集、下界管开集、率函数管衰减速率。<strong>第二章&quot;率函数&quot;</strong> 深入这条理论的核心对象：率函数的好性质（下半连续、紧水平集、唯一零点即典型值），Cramér 定理如何为独立同分布之和给出第一个 LDP，以及贯穿全书的 Legendre 变换如何把矩母函数变成率函数。<strong>第三章&quot;原理&quot;</strong> 是三件威力工具：Sanov 定理把率函数认成相对熵、Gärtner-Ellis 定理把 Cramér 推广到相依情形、收缩原理让 LDP 沿连续映射传递。<strong>第四章&quot;应用&quot;</strong> 把理论落到统计物理的熵与自由能、排队系统的溢出与金融的破产概率、以及重要性采样等稀有事件模拟的计算实践，并划清它与极值理论、中心极限定理的边界。</p>\n<p>四条主线并非并列，而是层层依赖：没有基础的指数尺度直觉，率函数只是空洞的凸函数；没有 Cramér 与 Legendre，三大原理无从落地；没有三大原理，应用中的每个率函数都要从头硬算。读者会看到同一个 Legendre 变换在 Cramér、Gärtner-Ellis、统计物理的自由能里反复出现——这正是大偏差理论&quot;一套语言统一众多稀有事件&quot;的魅力，也是 Varadhan 因&quot;创建统一的大偏差理论&quot;获 2007 年 Abel 奖的原因（<a href=\"https://www.ias.ac.in/article/fulltext/pmsc/118/02/0161-0182\">IAS 综述</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：本 hub 只讲&quot;稀有事件的指数衰减率&quot;这一件事。矩母函数、期望方差等概率基础属于 <a href=\"../probability-statistics/\">概率统计</a>，本 hub 只在需要时点到；相对熵、KL 散度的信息论内涵属于 <a href=\"../information-theory/\">信息论</a>，本 hub 只借用其作为率函数；凸对偶、Legendre 变换的一般优化背景属于 <a href=\"../optimization-theory/\">优化理论</a>，本 hub 聚焦它在率函数中的角色；布朗运动、鞅等随机过程属于 <a href=\"../stochastic-processes/\">随机过程</a>。特别要与 <a href=\"../extreme-value-theory/\">极值理论</a> 分清：极值理论研究&quot;最大值&quot;的极限分布，大偏差研究&quot;平均值大幅偏离&quot;的概率衰减率，二者都关心尾部却问不同的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。对第一次接触的读者：按 基础 → 率函数 → 原理 → 应用 顺序通读，每章内也按编号推进。对已有概率背景、想快速上手的工程读者：可从 Cramér 定理直接切入，再看 Gärtner-Ellis 与应用章的重要性采样，率函数的抽象性质回头补。对做统计物理或随机过程的读者：基础章 + 收缩原理 + 统计物理与熵三篇即可搭起框架。<strong>前置知识</strong>：需要基本的概率论（随机变量、期望、独立性、矩母函数）、微积分（凸函数、上下确界）与一点点测度直觉；不需要泛函分析或抽象概率的先修，遇到测度论术语本 hub 会就地解释。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：从涨落到指数律","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-large-deviations","title":"为何需要大偏差理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/foundations/why-large-deviations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rare-events","title":"稀有事件的指数尺度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/foundations/rare-events"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ldp-definition","title":"大偏差原理 (LDP) 的严格定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/foundations/ldp-definition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rate","title":"率函数：大偏差理论的核心对象","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-function","title":"率函数与好性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/rate-function"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cramer-theorem","title":"Cramér 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/cramer-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legendre-transform","title":"Legendre 变换与凸对偶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/legendre-transform"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"principles","title":"原理：三件放大稀有事件的工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sanov-theorem","title":"Sanov 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/sanov-theorem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gartner-ellis","title":"Gärtner-Ellis 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/gartner-ellis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contraction-principle","title":"收缩原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/contraction-principle"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用：让率函数下场干活","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-mechanics","title":"统计物理与熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice/statistical-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"queueing-finance","title":"排队与金融","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice/queueing-finance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"large-deviations-in-practice","title":"应用与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice/large-deviations-in-practice"}]}]}